.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-commit-check 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-commit\-check \- Refuse a commit subject that does not follow the configured convention
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten commit check\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-message\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIrange\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Refuse a commit subject that does not follow the configured convention
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-\-message\fR
Judge one pending commit message file, before the commit exists
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIrange\fR]
Judge every non\-merge commit in this range (<base>..<head>)
